  "description": "Relax and play through 100 levels of classic TriPeaks Solitaire wrapped in a cozy farm setting. Clear cards by chaining sequences up or down across three peaks, using power-ups when you're stuck and Undo whenever you need a second chance.\nCollect daily rewards to earn extra power-ups and coins, and work your way through every level at your own pace — no time limits, no pressure.\nFeatures:\n\n- 100 levels of TriPeaks Solitaire\n- Farm-themed visuals and card art\n- Power-ups to help on tough levels\n- Undo your last move at any time\n- Daily rewards\n",
